# The PDA, tasks page. The 3D PDA (raise animation, screen drawn into the hand) is switched off: the plain dialog is the one to look at.
1 console run_string xr_harness.env(12,0,"w_clear1")
2 console g_3d_pda off
26 key P
28 console run_string xr_harness.pda("eptTasks")
30 console screenshot 07_pda
32 key Escape
34 quit
